Chapter: RevisedNarrowAbsent
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 This is the same store with the __narrow removed. An unbounded Integer
 into a field bounded 0..100 is CDX2051, in a revised update exactly as
 in a record literal.

Section: Types

  Reading = record {
   level : Integer between 0 and 100,
   label : Text
  }

Section: Body

  bump : Reading, Integer -> Reading
  bump (r) (n) = r revised { level = n, label = "no-narrow" }

  opening : Text = "absent"
